# Host files cad's suites cannot load without, as paths relative to the
# Minerva checkout root, checked by scripts/run-gd-tests.sh before Godot
# starts. src/project.godot is required for every plugin and is checked
# unconditionally by the runner, so it is not repeated here.
#
# cad's suites currently need NOTHING beyond it: orbit_camera.gd is a
# self-contained Camera3D and the suite drives it directly, without the
# host's plugin-panel driver helpers. This file exists to say that on
# purpose — a suite that starts preloading res://test/helpers/... adds its
# line here so a Minerva SHA bump that drops the helper fails by name.
